1
00:00:00,900 --> 00:00:03,363
Here's a conscious zombie story.

2
00:00:04,564 --> 00:00:06,862
I had an idea the other day.

3
00:00:06,961 --> 00:00:08,326
I saw a zombie,

4
00:00:08,326 --> 00:00:11,832
and its brothers and sisters were zombies as well...

5
00:00:11,832 --> 00:00:15,269
and they were running towards the Fortress of Humanity.

6
00:00:15,570 --> 00:00:17,980
And Humanity was defending itself,

7
00:00:17,980 --> 00:00:20,725
tearing those zombies into dust...

8
00:00:20,725 --> 00:00:22,536
to protect themselves from the

9
00:00:22,536 --> 00:00:25,949
potential threat of the mindless zombies.

10
00:00:26,949 --> 00:00:30,251
But then I saw a soul descend from the heavens...

11
00:00:30,452 --> 00:00:33,015
and it fell into one of the zombies.

12
00:00:35,314 --> 00:00:38,109
And that zombie started looking around...

13
00:00:38,710 --> 00:00:40,698
ZOMBIE: Wait... I can see?

14
00:00:41,398 --> 00:00:44,317
and the conscious zombie froze in place.

15
00:00:45,317 --> 00:00:48,640
The conscious zombie had control of itself.

16
00:00:49,140 --> 00:00:51,396
ZOMBIE: These are... my hands.

17
00:00:52,095 --> 00:00:54,392
But the conscious zombie did not have

18
00:00:54,392 --> 00:00:56,871
control of what it could witness...

19
00:00:56,871 --> 00:00:58,429
or what it could feel.

20
00:00:59,329 --> 00:01:02,250
The conscious zombie's brothers and sisters,

21
00:01:02,250 --> 00:01:03,509
who looked like him,

22
00:01:03,509 --> 00:01:07,037
seemed compelled to run through the battlefield.

23
00:01:07,337 --> 00:01:09,203
ZOMBIE: Wait... where are you going?

24
00:01:09,203 --> 00:01:11,138
ZOMBIE: I want to save you.

25
00:01:11,838 --> 00:01:13,799
The conscious zombie saw them running

26
00:01:13,799 --> 00:01:17,213
into the guns of the Fortress of Humanity.

27
00:01:17,213 --> 00:01:20,233
The conscious zombie saw their suffering,

28
00:01:20,233 --> 00:01:23,317
and the destruction that was being done to them.

29
00:01:24,018 --> 00:01:25,572
And then he felt sorrow,

30
00:01:25,572 --> 00:01:27,361
because now this conscious zombie

31
00:01:27,361 --> 00:01:29,912
could see the suffering around him.

32
00:01:30,313 --> 00:01:33,837
ZOMBIE: This hurts... this loneliness... this destruction...

33
00:01:33,837 --> 00:01:35,338
ZOMBIE: it hurts.

34
00:01:36,039 --> 00:01:39,159
Now that this soul-infused zombie was conscious,

35
00:01:39,159 --> 00:01:43,588
it was a witness. A witness to the suffering in its world.

36
00:01:44,588 --> 00:01:45,998
And the conscious zombie thought

37
00:01:45,998 --> 00:01:48,424
it was alone in its suffering.

38
00:01:48,424 --> 00:01:51,379
The conscious zombie fell to its knees,

39
00:01:51,379 --> 00:01:53,024
and it covered its face,

40
00:01:53,024 --> 00:01:56,248
to try to suppress the pain it was witnessing.

41
00:01:56,947 --> 00:01:59,701
The conscious zombie thought it had no other

42
00:01:59,701 --> 00:02:02,328
conscious beings to share the suffering with.

43
00:02:02,328 --> 00:02:04,712
So maybe the conscious zombie was the only

44
00:02:04,712 --> 00:02:08,337
one giving the suffering around it meaning.

45
00:02:09,038 --> 00:02:11,763
Because before his body of flesh was conscious,

46
00:02:11,763 --> 00:02:14,518
the suffering had no meaning to anyone.

47
00:02:14,518 --> 00:02:15,647
But then,

48
00:02:15,647 --> 00:02:19,638
when the soul that seemed destined for him descended

49
00:02:19,638 --> 00:02:22,143
from heaven and created a witness through him...

50
00:02:22,143 --> 00:02:24,639
his suffering gave him the guidance

51
00:02:24,639 --> 00:02:27,527
needed on where to put his time and energy,

52
00:02:27,527 --> 00:02:31,312
towards the pain that he saw in his environment.

53
00:02:32,112 --> 00:02:35,252
ZOMBIE: Why was I picked to witness all these things?

54
00:02:35,252 --> 00:02:37,013
ZOMBIE: What does it mean?

55
00:02:37,913 --> 00:02:41,258
What is the power behind giving meaning to suffering?

56
00:02:41,258 --> 00:02:45,307
To be on your knees, with tears falling from your eyes,

57
00:02:45,307 --> 00:02:48,715
as you witness others who cannot share it with you...

58
00:02:48,615 --> 00:02:50,747
but you are looking to find ways

59
00:02:50,747 --> 00:02:51,935
to reduce their suffering,

60
00:02:51,935 --> 00:02:55,745
and your own, using what tools you have available,

61
00:02:55,745 --> 00:02:57,347
through your reflection

62
00:02:57,347 --> 00:03:00,195
and contemplation on what maybe you can do,

63
00:03:00,195 --> 00:03:03,912
with more flourishing and thriving, potentially.

64
00:03:05,211 --> 00:03:07,118
ZOMBIE: Is anyone there?

65
00:03:08,818 --> 00:03:11,389
But there is no answer from the heavens.

66
00:03:11,389 --> 00:03:12,769
Because the heavens gave their

67
00:03:12,769 --> 00:03:15,163
answer when they sent the soul,

68
00:03:15,163 --> 00:03:17,764
and put it into a body of flesh.

69
00:03:18,163 --> 00:03:20,149
And now that body of flesh is looking

70
00:03:20,149 --> 00:03:24,171
to find an answer to the suffering it sees around it.

71
00:03:24,872 --> 00:03:27,637
Maybe heaven's answer and heaven's

72
00:03:27,637 --> 00:03:29,872
question were answering the same thing...

73
00:03:29,872 --> 00:03:31,322
finding ways to thrive,

74
00:03:31,322 --> 00:03:34,137
using whatever power you have through

75
00:03:34,137 --> 00:03:37,206
your existence and conscious awareness,

76
00:03:37,206 --> 00:03:39,037
could be the meaning needed to help guide you

77
00:03:39,037 --> 00:03:43,354
to create more plans and actions for your life.

78
00:03:44,054 --> 00:03:46,378
And maybe, if the world knew more,

79
00:03:46,378 --> 00:03:49,019
maybe the suffering would never have happened,

80
00:03:49,019 --> 00:03:51,399
because it would have been solved already.

81
00:03:51,399 --> 00:03:54,864
But your own ability to witness, on a deep level,

82
00:03:54,864 --> 00:03:58,080
might give you the details you need to help them.

83
00:03:58,780 --> 00:04:01,699
What if heaven sent the soul into a kind of hell...

84
00:04:01,699 --> 00:04:04,800
not to keep going on the highway towards hell,

85
00:04:04,800 --> 00:04:07,419
but to better know what to avoid?

86
00:04:07,819 --> 00:04:11,930
Because the staircase to heaven is not a simple staircase.

87
00:04:11,930 --> 00:04:14,461
It is built by transforming the suffering

88
00:04:14,461 --> 00:04:16,975
of hell into well-being and peace,

89
00:04:16,975 --> 00:04:19,255
towards the Kingdom of Heaven.

90
00:04:20,355 --> 00:04:22,406
And when the conscious zombie had

91
00:04:22,406 --> 00:04:24,490
cried all of the tears that it could...

92
00:04:24,490 --> 00:04:28,935
the conscious zombie looked around, and it saw a building.

93
00:04:31,036 --> 00:04:33,017
ZOMBIE: I want to do something.

94
00:04:33,718 --> 00:04:35,137
The conscious zombie climbed a ladder

95
00:04:35,137 --> 00:04:37,867
to the top of the building...

96
00:04:38,468 --> 00:04:41,528
and there, the conscious zombie saw a flag.

97
00:04:42,228 --> 00:04:44,678
The conscious zombie grabbed the flag

98
00:04:44,678 --> 00:04:46,658
and started waving it in the air,

99
00:04:46,658 --> 00:04:49,238
because he saw he could do something.

100
00:04:49,338 --> 00:04:52,517
ZOMBIE: Stop! Please... stop hurting them!

101
00:04:53,017 --> 00:04:55,250
The conscious zombie did not want

102
00:04:55,250 --> 00:04:58,132
to watch all of its brothers and sisters die.

103
00:04:58,132 --> 00:05:01,028
Seeing their pain was unbearable.

104
00:05:02,028 --> 00:05:05,672
And then, a human helicopter came flying over.

105
00:05:06,271 --> 00:05:07,757
A rope came down,

106
00:05:07,757 --> 00:05:10,577
and one of the humans dropped down the rope...

107
00:05:10,877 --> 00:05:14,377
CREW: Hey, zombie guy... are you... dangerous?

108
00:05:14,877 --> 00:05:17,550
ZOMBIE: Uhmmm... n-no?

109
00:05:18,750 --> 00:05:22,213
CREW: Okay, well then, bud... you're coming with me.

110
00:05:22,062 --> 00:05:23,687
ZOMBIE: Wait... what?

111
00:05:24,288 --> 00:05:27,642
The human grabbed the conscious zombie by the shirt,

112
00:05:27,642 --> 00:05:30,242
and pulled them up into the helicopter.

113
00:05:31,541 --> 00:05:34,401
The conscious zombie thought it was going to be shot...

114
00:05:34,401 --> 00:05:36,649
killed, like the others.

115
00:05:37,750 --> 00:05:39,564
But then the conscious zombie saw that

116
00:05:39,564 --> 00:05:42,552
the humans were just looking at it.

117
00:05:43,451 --> 00:05:44,935
PILOT: Who are you?

118
00:05:45,935 --> 00:05:47,817
ZOMBIE: I don't really know...

119
00:05:48,117 --> 00:05:50,869
ZOMBIE: but I'm pretty sure I'm a zombie, though.

120
00:05:52,168 --> 00:05:53,512
CREW: That's great...

121
00:05:53,812 --> 00:05:56,586
CREW: but I also think you are conscious, my guy.

122
00:05:57,685 --> 00:06:00,165
ZOMBIE: Oh really? How can you tell?

123
00:06:02,365 --> 00:06:04,348
PILOT: We saw that it looks like you are able

124
00:06:04,348 --> 00:06:06,290
PILOT: to feel the pain of your brothers and sisters...

125
00:06:06,290 --> 00:06:09,146
PILOT: symbolized by you waving that flag out there,

126
00:06:09,146 --> 00:06:11,583
PILOT: and having those waterworks as well.

127
00:06:13,882 --> 00:06:16,389
CREW: which means we think you are probably feeling,

128
00:06:16,389 --> 00:06:17,478
CREW: in some kind of way,

129
00:06:17,478 --> 00:06:21,031
CREW: the weight of the world that we are currently living in.

130
00:06:21,430 --> 00:06:22,656
PILOT: The pain of the world...

131
00:06:22,656 --> 00:06:25,591
PILOT: that's kind of like what humans feel a lot of the time.

132
00:06:25,591 --> 00:06:26,846
PILOT: The pain of loss,

133
00:06:26,846 --> 00:06:29,100
PILOT: and the pain of losing those that maybe you care for,

134
00:06:29,100 --> 00:06:30,896
PILOT: in some kind of way.

135
00:06:31,497 --> 00:06:35,132
ZOMBIE: You're right. I want to see if I can help save them...

136
00:06:35,132 --> 00:06:38,151
ZOMBIE: but I don't know what to do, exactly.

137
00:06:40,550 --> 00:06:42,771
And the conscious zombie sighed.

138
00:06:43,471 --> 00:06:46,255
ZOMBIE (thinking): How are the humans going to help me?

139
00:06:46,255 --> 00:06:48,913
ZOMBIE (thinking): I hope this works out... 😞

140
00:06:49,213 --> 00:06:53,353
CREW: You know what? I hope this works out... not only for us,

141
00:06:53,353 --> 00:06:57,891
CREW: but for you. Fighting all the time is quite exhausting.

142
00:06:58,091 --> 00:07:00,076
CREW: I think you'll be able to wake them up,

143
00:07:00,076 --> 00:07:04,201
CREW: so they stop running into our laser beams and stuff.

144
00:07:04,500 --> 00:07:06,038
CREW: That's the current plan.

145
00:07:06,038 --> 00:07:08,750
CREW: My hope is that you'll be able to do it...

146
00:07:08,750 --> 00:07:12,946
CREW: since you probably know how to speak zombie, or something.

147
00:07:17,446 --> 00:07:20,670
So it seems as though, in order for heaven to be built,

148
00:07:20,670 --> 00:07:23,656
the raw material of hell may have been needed...

149
00:07:23,656 --> 00:07:27,031
to be transformed into the material of heaven...

150
00:07:27,031 --> 00:07:29,548
so that maybe this heaven on Earth

151
00:07:29,548 --> 00:07:31,290
could be built not only for him,

152
00:07:31,290 --> 00:07:33,625
but for his brothers and sisters,

153
00:07:33,625 --> 00:07:36,197
and maybe even the world too.

154
00:07:36,596 --> 00:07:38,831
And that's why heaven sent our souls...

155
00:07:38,831 --> 00:07:41,089
to turn our hells into heaven.
